msgstr "Apporte quelque chose pour le repas partagé : %(note)s"

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/coming.html:15
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/coming.txt:22
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/reminder.html:22
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/reminder.txt:24
msgid "Can't come after all? Please say so on the page, so someone else can have your place:"
msgstr "Finalement tu ne peux pas venir ? Dis-le sur la page, pour que quelqu'un d'autre puisse prendre ta place :"

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/coming.html:16
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/coming.txt:24
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/guest_coming.html:15
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/guest_coming.txt:22
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/host.html:15
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/host.txt:23
msgid "The calendar file is attached."
msgstr "Le fichier de calendrier est en pièce jointe."

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/guest_coming.html:7
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/guest_coming.txt:10
msgid "Advice: be careful what you wish for, it might come true ;)"
msgstr "Conseil : fais attention à ce que tu souhaites, ça pourrait se réaliser ;)"

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/guest_coming.html:14
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/guest_coming.txt:20
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/reminder.html:20
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/reminder.txt:22
msgid "Change or cancel your sign-up:"
msgstr "Modifier ou annuler ton inscription :"

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/guest_confirm.html:3
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/guest_confirm.txt:3
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/guest_confirm.html:13
#, python-format
msgid "You signed up for the gift-circle %(title)s on ecobasa. Please confirm it's you:"
msgstr "Tu t'es inscrit·e au cercle de dons %(title)s sur ecobasa. Merci de confirmer que c'est bien toi :"

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/guest_confirm.html:5
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/guest_confirm.txt:7
msgid "Only after that do you count as coming, and only then do we write to you again. If it wasn't you, ignore this email and we won't write again."
msgstr "Ce n'est qu'après que tu comptes parmi les participant·es, et seulement alors que nous t'écrivons de nouveau. Si ce n'était pas toi, ignore cet e-mail et nous ne t'écrirons plus."

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/host.html:3
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/host.txt:3
msgid "Thank you for inviting to a gift-circle! Here is everything you need on the day."
msgstr "Merci d'inviter à un cercle de dons ! Voici tout ce qu'il te faut pour le jour J."

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/host.html:5
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/host.txt:9
msgid "Share this page so people can come:"
msgstr "Partage cette page pour que les gens puissent venir :"

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/host.html:7
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/host.txt:12
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/print.html:49
msgid "Your facilitator card"
msgstr "Ta fiche d'animation"

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/host.html:8
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/host.txt:14
msgid "Print it, or keep this email open on your phone."
msgstr "Imprime-la, ou garde cet e-mail ouvert sur ton téléphone."

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/host.html:12
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/host.txt:20
msgid "Printable Giftsheet and this card:"
msgstr "Feuille des dons à imprimer et cette fiche :"

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/host.html:13
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/host.txt:21
msgid "Your gift-circle's page:"
msgstr "La page de ton cercle de dons :"

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/host.html:16
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/host.txt:25
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/invitation.html:15
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/invitation.txt:21
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/tour_invitation.html:12
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/tour_invitation.txt:19
msgid "Happy giving!"
msgstr "Bons dons !"

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/invitation.html:9
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/invitation.txt:15
msgid "People sit in a circle and share what they wish for and what they can give. Things, time, skills, knowledge, contacts. Nothing is bought or sold."
msgstr "Des personnes s'assoient en cercle et partagent ce qu'elles souhaitent et ce qu'elles peuvent donner. Objets, temps, compétences, savoirs, contacts. Rien ne s'achète ni ne se vend."

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/invitation.html:9
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/invitation.txt:15
msgid "Strangers often leave as neighbours who help each other."
msgstr "Des inconnu·es repartent souvent en voisin·es qui s'entraident."

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/invitation.html:13
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/invitation.txt:19
#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s gave us your address for this gift-circle only. Not coming? Tell us, and we delete it:"
msgstr "%(name)s nous a donné ton adresse pour ce cercle de dons uniquement. Tu ne viens pas ? Dis-le-nous et nous la supprimons :"

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/reminder.html:3
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/reminder.txt:3
#, python-format
msgid "Tomorrow is the gift-circle %(title)s, hosted by %(host)s."
msgstr "Demain a lieu le cercle de dons %(title)s, organisé par %(host)s."

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/reminder.html:7
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/reminder.txt:8
msgid "Others who come have what you wish for, or wish for what you have. Bring it along, so it can change hands there:"
msgstr "D'autres qui viennent ont ce que tu souhaites, ou souhaitent ce que tu as. Apporte-le, il pourra changer de mains sur place :"

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/reminder.html:12
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/reminder.txt:12
msgid "See what the others bring:"
msgstr "Vois ce que les autres apportent :"

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/reminder.html:17
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/reminder.txt:18
msgid "Found a scribe yet? Your card and the Giftsheet to print:"
msgstr "Tu as trouvé un·e scribe ? Ta fiche et la feuille des dons à imprimer :"

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/tour_invitation.html:3
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/tour_invitation.txt:3
#, python-format
msgid "Your tour %(tour)s invites to a gift-circle where it stops. You're on the tour there, so you're very welcome."
msgstr "Ton tour %(tour)s invite à un cercle de dons à l'une de ses étapes. Tu es du voyage à ce moment-là, alors tu es le ou la bienvenu·e."

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/giftsheet.html:13
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/views.py:522
msgid "The Giftsheet is closed."
msgstr "La feuille des dons est close."

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/giftsheet.html:43
msgid "With an email they get the results too."
msgstr "Avec un e-mail, la personne reçoit aussi les résultats."

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/giftsheet.html:83
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/giftsheet.html:87
msgid "Add a photo of the Giftsheet"
